(3572211, 501038, 6804, '<td valign="top">Most of my favorite works are compositions of ordinary things captured in an extraordinary way.  I think youve achieved that with this one.  It is excellent!</td>', 'Most of my favorite works are compositions of ordinary things captured in an extraordinary way.  I think youve achieved that with this one.  It is excellent!', '2007-04-23 01:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
