(3572232, 501016, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is an artistic and creative gem! Also, my first 10 of the challenge.  I can''t offer any suggestions for improving this one.  It''s perfect!</td>', 'This is an artistic and creative gem! Also, my first 10 of the challenge.  I can''t offer any suggestions for improving this one.  It''s perfect!', '2007-04-23 02:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
