(3572301, 501497, 69487, '<td valign="top">Jesus cant even save it.....</td>', 'Jesus cant even save it.....', '2007-04-23 03:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572306, 501487, 69487, '<td valign="top">That Fork Has Gotten Alot Of Use......! 7</td>', 'That Fork Has Gotten Alot Of Use......! 7', '2007-04-23 03:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572326, 498532, 65173, '<td valign="top">crooked, cluttered composition, lacks meaning</td>', 'crooked, cluttered composition, lacks meaning', '2007-04-23 03:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572328, 501468, 65173, '<td valign="top">well thought-out composition, and cool old coffee grinder.  i sort of feel like the shininess of the press and scoop takes away from the antique feel, though.   and i wish i could see what the press is sitting on -- it sort of looks like it''s floating to me.</td>', 'well thought-out composition, and cool old coffee grinder.  i sort of feel like the shininess of the press and scoop takes away from the antique feel, though.   and i wish i could see what the press is sitting on -- it sort of looks like it''s floating to me.', '2007-04-23 03:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572332, 501396, 65173, '<td valign="top">i really like the simplicity of the composition and shape.  the texture and tonal range also appeals to me a lot too.  the one disturbing thing to me is the shadow on the right side -- it doesn''t look real because of the halo around the spoons.  i figure the halo was added in postprocessing?</td>', 'i really like the simplicity of the composition and shape.  the texture and tonal range also appeals to me a lot too.  the one disturbing thing to me is the shadow on the right side -- it doesn''t look real because of the halo around the spoons.  i figure the halo was added in postprocessing?', '2007-04-23 03:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572334, 500245, 65173, '<td valign="top">i like the focus on the very front bit, and the texture and moody feel.  the subject isn''t very interesting to me, though.  it looks like sort of a variation on a plain-jane product shot, i think.  i wonder if there''s some way to work in any additional elements?...</td>', 'i like the focus on the very front bit, and the texture and moody feel.  the subject isn''t very interesting to me, though.  it looks like sort of a variation on a plain-jane product shot, i think.  i wonder if there''s some way to work in any additional elements?...', '2007-04-23 03:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572335, 501340, 65173, '<td valign="top">the fakey vignetting takes away from what i think is a really cool idea, where each tool has done something somehow inappropriate to a piece of wood...  i''m also not a fan of the blue surface against the yellowish wood -- the colors don''t go well together.</td>', 'the fakey vignetting takes away from what i think is a really cool idea, where each tool has done something somehow inappropriate to a piece of wood...  i''m also not a fan of the blue surface against the yellowish wood -- the colors don''t go well together.', '2007-04-23 03:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572338, 501432, 65173, '<td valign="top">i love bamboo texture, and you did a clever trick using tatami as a backdrop.  but i think you were trying to produce a glow coming from inside the bamboo steamer, that i think doesn''t come out as glowy enough at all because the rest of the shot is so brightly lit.</td>', 'i love bamboo texture, and you did a clever trick using tatami as a backdrop.  but i think you were trying to produce a glow coming from inside the bamboo steamer, that i think doesn''t come out as glowy enough at all because the rest of the shot is so brightly lit.', '2007-04-23 03:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572341, 500825, 65173, '<td valign="top">cute!  i love the idea, and it''s really well executed.  something feels off to me about the composition, though.  i can''t quite put a finger on it.  not sure, but i think i want the whisk''s shadow to be more looming, somehow.</td>', 'cute!  i love the idea, and it''s really well executed.  something feels off to me about the composition, though.  i can''t quite put a finger on it.  not sure, but i think i want the whisk''s shadow to be more looming, somehow.', '2007-04-23 03:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572344, 501494, 65173, '<td valign="top">this image has a lot of initial bang -- i thought "woo cool!" when i first clicked.  but there are subtle asymmetries and misalignments in the composition that kind of throw it off for me.  it''s a really challenging concept to execute because it has to be *absolutely perfect*.  i dig the tonal range though, and the simple silver-on-green.  nice image.</td>', 'this image has a lot of initial bang -- i thought "woo cool!" when i first clicked.  but there are subtle asymmetries and misalignments in the composition that kind of throw it off for me.  it''s a really challenging concept to execute because it has to be *absolutely perfect*.  i dig the tonal range though, and the simple silver-on-green.  nice image.', '2007-04-23 03:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572349, 501154, 65173, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting, color and texture.  i love antiques.  the composition is bottom-heavy though -- there''s a lot of weight there that attracts my eye to the asymmetrical iron parts of the stove, which i don''t really like.  i''d want it cropped to a square, such that a little is taken off of the right (to center the pots), and that it''s like a 2-to-1 ratio of top area to bottom area.</td>', 'very nice lighting, color and texture.  i love antiques.  the composition is bottom-heavy though -- there''s a lot of weight there that attracts my eye to the asymmetrical iron parts of the stove, which i don''t really like.  i''d want it cropped to a square, such that a little is taken off of the right (to center the pots), and that it''s like a 2-to-1 ratio of top area to bottom area.', '2007-04-23 03:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572356, 500905, 65173, '<td valign="top">i like this -- it''s abstract in a way, and has a lot of shape to it.  i wish it weren''t so heavily saturated, though.  i think you lost some texture, especially in the eggshell, that would have come out better with less saturation.</td>', 'i like this -- it''s abstract in a way, and has a lot of shape to it.  i wish it weren''t so heavily saturated, though.  i think you lost some texture, especially in the eggshell, that would have come out better with less saturation.', '2007-04-23 03:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572358, 501069, 65173, '<td valign="top">composition is nice, but there''s some problem with the lighting.  looks like it''s lit from a window on the left and a room light behind the camera, which gives different color temperatures, and which flatten out the depth in the image.</td>', 'composition is nice, but there''s some problem with the lighting.  looks like it''s lit from a window on the left and a room light behind the camera, which gives different color temperatures, and which flatten out the depth in the image.', '2007-04-23 04:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572362, 501066, 65173, '<td valign="top">composition is weighted too heavily toward the left, i think.  also, boo on words -- they diffuse any subtext the image might have had.  if you''re going for the "sleep is for the weak" theme, there are more metaphoric ways of going about it (but then again, they probably wouldn''t have fit with the challenge theme).</td>', 'composition is weighted too heavily toward the left, i think.  also, boo on words -- they diffuse any subtext the image might have had.  if you''re going for the "sleep is for the weak" theme, there are more metaphoric ways of going about it (but then again, they probably wouldn''t have fit with the challenge theme).', '2007-04-23 04:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572364, 501487, 65173, '<td valign="top">sweet.  perfectly "posed" and the play with depth of field here is also a great effect.  nice composition too.  the one thing that hurts the image for me is the unsharp mask haloes around the edges of the fork.</td>', 'sweet.  perfectly "posed" and the play with depth of field here is also a great effect.  nice composition too.  the one thing that hurts the image for me is the unsharp mask haloes around the edges of the fork.', '2007-04-23 04:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572370, 501438, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beeeeautiful!!!</td>', 'Beeeeautiful!!!', '2007-04-23 04:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572371, 501486, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!</td>', 'Great perspective!', '2007-04-23 04:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572373, 501460, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.</td>', 'Very beautiful.', '2007-04-23 04:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572374, 500816, 53316, '<td valign="top">Lovely smile.  Great composition.</td>', 'Lovely smile.  Great composition.', '2007-04-23 04:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572378, 501498, 65173, '<td valign="top">very cool idea, and i really like the shape of the fork.  there are a few things that detract from the image for me, though.  the hand is pretty overwhelming in the composition, and is out of the frame a bit at the top.  the weird blurry lines in the hand, also...  i don''t understand what they are so i keep gravitating toward them.  and lastly, the hdr technique -- the way it brings out noise in the dark areas and leaves a really visible halo around the hand -- it''s too much.  this is a concept you should keep playing with, though -- it has a lot of possibility.</td>', 'very cool idea, and i really like the shape of the fork.  there are a few things that detract from the image for me, though.  the hand is pretty overwhelming in the composition, and is out of the frame a bit at the top.  the weird blurry lines in the hand, also...  i don''t understand what they are so i keep gravitating toward them.  and lastly, the hdr technique -- the way it brings out noise in the dark areas and leaves a really visible halo around the hand -- it''s too much.  this is a concept you should keep playing with, though -- it has a lot of possibility.', '2007-04-23 04:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572392, 501110, 49109, '<td valign="top">overall a tad too dark, might have been better to place the candle closer to the center for a better lighting. otherwise nicely arranged.</td>', 'overall a tad too dark, might have been better to place the candle closer to the center for a better lighting. otherwise nicely arranged.', '2007-04-23 04:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572393, 501048, 49109, '<td valign="top">lighting is too flat. looks oversaturated.</td>', 'lighting is too flat. looks oversaturated.', '2007-04-23 04:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572395, 498532, 49109, '<td valign="top">tilted, distorted, no clear focus</td>', 'tilted, distorted, no clear focus', '2007-04-23 04:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572396, 501205, 49109, '<td valign="top">well exposed shot of a disgusting subject</td>', 'well exposed shot of a disgusting subject', '2007-04-23 04:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572407, 501494, 49109, '<td valign="top">"your task is to shoot the stuff you use to PREPARE your food!<br/> <br/>besides that, the shot is too dark and the angle you have taken it from in combination with the pattern of the cloth and the unusual aspect ratio produces  different vanishing points which is somehow irritating</td>', '"your task is to shoot the stuff you use to PREPARE your food! besides that, the shot is too dark and the angle you have taken it from in combination with the pattern of the cloth and the unusual aspect ratio produces  different vanishing points which is somehow irritating', '2007-04-23 04:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572408, 501333, 49109, '<td valign="top">"your task is to shoot the stuff you use to PREPARE your food!"<br/> <br/>besides that, a nice reflection on the fork would have enhanced the image much</td>', '"your task is to shoot the stuff you use to PREPARE your food!" besides that, a nice reflection on the fork would have enhanced the image much', '2007-04-23 04:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
