(3572742, 501005, 67152, '<td valign="top">This challenge clearly meets the challenge but the lighting and cropping on this image need some more work - the lighting appears to be on the corner cabinet door at the bottom of the image and the neat pans and pots are not as highlighted as they could be.  I would have recommended reshooting this focusing on the pots and pans and getting some good light on them to bring out some nice detail and contrast to the image. 5</td>', 'This challenge clearly meets the challenge but the lighting and cropping on this image need some more work - the lighting appears to be on the corner cabinet door at the bottom of the image and the neat pans and pots are not as highlighted as they could be.  I would have recommended reshooting this focusing on the pots and pans and getting some good light on them to bring out some nice detail and contrast to the image. 5', '2007-04-23 08:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572753, 501381, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I want one, I want one - the Kitchen Aid, that is, not the ghost!  A similar idea to the one I came up with, but didn''t enter as however hard I tried, I couldn''t get my 30 year old Kenwood Chef to look photogenic!  That said, I would never have been able to produce a photograph as good as this, well composed, good choice of exposure, and very well presented.</td>', 'Ooh, I want one, I want one - the Kitchen Aid, that is, not the ghost!  A similar idea to the one I came up with, but didn''t enter as however hard I tried, I couldn''t get my 30 year old Kenwood Chef to look photogenic!  That said, I would never have been able to produce a photograph as good as this, well composed, good choice of exposure, and very well presented.', '2007-04-23 08:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572757, 501409, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love the light on the pot on the stove.  This part of the photo is excellent - great color and shape displayed.  The blown out window really takes away from the rest of the image for me.  Getting in closer (or cropping) to change the perspective so that only the stove is in the image and cutting out the window behind would really improve the image in my opinion.</td>', 'I love the light on the pot on the stove.  This part of the photo is excellent - great color and shape displayed.  The blown out window really takes away from the rest of the image for me.  Getting in closer (or cropping) to change the perspective so that only the stove is in the image and cutting out the window behind would really improve the image in my opinion.', '2007-04-23 08:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572763, 501498, 68035, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, you have bent the prongs of the fork delicately and to perfection.  Shadows a touch distracting but still a great image</td>', 'Fantastic shot, you have bent the prongs of the fork delicately and to perfection.  Shadows a touch distracting but still a great image', '2007-04-23 08:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572764, 498532, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a shame the focus isn''t a little crisper, as I do like the composition; the photo has the hint of narrative about it, rather than being a straight record shot - I find myself exploring the picture, wondering about the lives of the people who live here.  If you didn''t use it, some sharpening in photo editing would be beneficial.</td>', 'What a shame the focus isn''t a little crisper, as I do like the composition; the photo has the hint of narrative about it, rather than being a straight record shot - I find myself exploring the picture, wondering about the lives of the people who live here.  If you didn''t use it, some sharpening in photo editing would be beneficial.', '2007-04-23 08:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
