(3573171, 501487, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is really creative and funny. B&amp;W is a good choice - no colors to distract from the impact of the shapes (assuming there were other colors than black/gray/white to begin with :) ).</td>', 'This is really creative and funny. B&W is a good choice - no colors to distract from the impact of the shapes (assuming there were other colors than black/gray/white to begin with :) ).', '2007-04-23 11:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
