(3573254, 499338, 66353, '<td valign="top">A bit overdone on the tone mapping IMO - but a nice picture. 6... (a less processed version would probably have gotten a 7)</td>', 'A bit overdone on the tone mapping IMO - but a nice picture. 6... (a less processed version would probably have gotten a 7)', '2007-04-23 12:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
