(3573421, 501015, 65173, '<td valign="top">really nice composition and lighting.  the two things that bother me are the black halos around the knife and apple (probably from unsharp mask) and the fact that the apple is the only thing with any color, which makes it look composited or fake somehow to me...  i wish the knife had a bit of color in it -- especially a hint of green to show that the apple really is sitting on it.</td>', 'really nice composition and lighting.  the two things that bother me are the black halos around the knife and apple (probably from unsharp mask) and the fact that the apple is the only thing with any color, which makes it look composited or fake somehow to me...  i wish the knife had a bit of color in it -- especially a hint of green to show that the apple really is sitting on it.', '2007-04-23 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573423, 499702, 65173, '<td valign="top">i love it!  great idea, great lighting, composition, everything.  10/10.</td>', 'i love it!  great idea, great lighting, composition, everything.  10/10.', '2007-04-23 12:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573426, 500857, 72167, '<td valign="top">yes...!! That''s more like it!</td>', 'yes...!! That''s more like it!', '2007-04-23 12:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573427, 499848, 66267, '<td valign="top">Wow, i sure could go for some of that right about now.</td>', 'Wow, i sure could go for some of that right about now.', '2007-04-23 12:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573428, 501205, 65173, '<td valign="top">i suspect you went to a lot of effort to make this image, but i unfortunately can''t tell what i''m looking at...</td>', 'i suspect you went to a lot of effort to make this image, but i unfortunately can''t tell what i''m looking at...', '2007-04-23 12:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573433, 499148, 18197, '<td valign="top">To my eye, this is over exposed, with poor color balance, orientation and resolution. I am wondering if it was taken with a camera phone?<br/> <br/>Suggest reading the tutorial regardng preparing a photo for DPC Challenges. I think it will help you present the best your images have to offer.</td>', 'To my eye, this is over exposed, with poor color balance, orientation and resolution. I am wondering if it was taken with a camera phone? Suggest reading the tutorial regardng preparing a photo for DPC Challenges. I think it will help you present the best your images have to offer.', '2007-04-23 12:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573441, 501007, 65173, '<td valign="top">cool composition and very polished lighting.  this would make a nice cover image for a cookbook!  the only nit i can pick is that the right spoon is slightly lower than the left one.</td>', 'cool composition and very polished lighting.  this would make a nice cover image for a cookbook!  the only nit i can pick is that the right spoon is slightly lower than the left one.', '2007-04-23 13:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573444, 500805, 18197, '<td valign="top">To my eye, this is a bit over exposed, with poor color balance, orientation and resolution. I am wondering if it was taken with a camera phone?<br/> <br/>Suggest reading the tutorial regardng preparing a photo for DPC Challenges. I think it will help you present the best your images have to offer.</td>', 'To my eye, this is a bit over exposed, with poor color balance, orientation and resolution. I am wondering if it was taken with a camera phone? Suggest reading the tutorial regardng preparing a photo for DPC Challenges. I think it will help you present the best your images have to offer.', '2007-04-23 13:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573453, 501467, 18197, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is interesting and you''ve done a nice job capturing texture. But otherwise it doesn''t hold my interest much.</td>', 'The depth of field is interesting and you''ve done a nice job capturing texture. But otherwise it doesn''t hold my interest much.', '2007-04-23 13:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573458, 501292, 65173, '<td valign="top">i like the perspective, and the b&amp;w treatment.  the dead-center flash actually works unusually well for me too.  but nothing in the subject really holds my interest -- it''s just a pot boiling over.</td>', 'i like the perspective, and the b&w treatment.  the dead-center flash actually works unusually well for me too.  but nothing in the subject really holds my interest -- it''s just a pot boiling over.', '2007-04-23 13:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573477, 501430, 65173, '<td valign="top">nice composition and good tonal range, especially in the mouth of the thing.  however i wish you hadn''t taken the shot against the bricks -- i think they make the gold tone and the antiqueness of the piece lose some of its impact.  actually, if you''d been able to find a cobblestone road that would have been perfect :)</td>', 'nice composition and good tonal range, especially in the mouth of the thing.  however i wish you hadn''t taken the shot against the bricks -- i think they make the gold tone and the antiqueness of the piece lose some of its impact.  actually, if you''d been able to find a cobblestone road that would have been perfect :)', '2007-04-23 13:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573494, 500978, 65173, '<td valign="top">hehehehe, nice.  very cool idea.  i''d have wanted it to be set up a bit differently though, so that the background is just black.  if you could have turned the whole thing around 90 degrees so that the stovetop controls weren''t visible, that would bring out the mixer more, i think.  i''m giving it a 7/10.</td>', 'hehehehe, nice.  very cool idea.  i''d have wanted it to be set up a bit differently though, so that the background is just black.  if you could have turned the whole thing around 90 degrees so that the stovetop controls weren''t visible, that would bring out the mixer more, i think.  i''m giving it a 7/10.', '2007-04-23 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573503, 501458, 65173, '<td valign="top">very cool!  you just reminded me, i need to use my laser pointer more...  the one thing that bothers me is that the laser shape is weighted a bit to the right, which i think spoils the centered composition.  also, i wish there were some overlap in the two elements.</td>', 'very cool!  you just reminded me, i need to use my laser pointer more...  the one thing that bothers me is that the laser shape is weighted a bit to the right, which i think spoils the centered composition.  also, i wish there were some overlap in the two elements.', '2007-04-23 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573511, 500774, 65173, '<td valign="top">oh man, i know how hard it is to polish glass and chrome so that they''re perfect for a photo.  even if they''re brand new, fingerprints always end up getting all over the place.  so seriously, kudos.  the composition is very cool too, and the lighting is spot on.</td>', 'oh man, i know how hard it is to polish glass and chrome so that they''re perfect for a photo.  even if they''re brand new, fingerprints always end up getting all over the place.  so seriously, kudos.  the composition is very cool too, and the lighting is spot on.', '2007-04-23 13:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573521, 500590, 65173, '<td valign="top">nice idea and lighting, but the composition bothers me.  it''s neither centered nor weighted, and neither straight nor angled...  seems lacking in intention.</td>', 'nice idea and lighting, but the composition bothers me.  it''s neither centered nor weighted, and neither straight nor angled...  seems lacking in intention.', '2007-04-23 13:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573529, 501374, 65173, '<td valign="top">wow, nice.  i really like the idea, the colors and the composition.  did you use a polarizer to get the deep blue?</td>', 'wow, nice.  i really like the idea, the colors and the composition.  did you use a polarizer to get the deep blue?', '2007-04-23 13:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573534, 501405, 65173, '<td valign="top">cool lighting, but the image lacks context and composition.  it''s just sitting there in the void of space.</td>', 'cool lighting, but the image lacks context and composition.  it''s just sitting there in the void of space.', '2007-04-23 13:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573545, 500722, 65173, '<td valign="top">wow!  very dynamic feel, and amazing color.  i wish the perspective were a bit different, though.  the shadow cast by the blender, the cut-off base, and the tabletop all spoil the surreal, otherworldly feel for me.</td>', 'wow!  very dynamic feel, and amazing color.  i wish the perspective were a bit different, though.  the shadow cast by the blender, the cut-off base, and the tabletop all spoil the surreal, otherworldly feel for me.', '2007-04-23 13:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573546, 501038, 65173, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and texture</td>', 'nice lighting and texture', '2007-04-23 13:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573554, 500531, 65173, '<td valign="top">cool subject -- i''ve seen these before -- but i think it would have more impact if it were just one or two knives, and against a totally black background.  as shot, i think it''s too mundane.</td>', 'cool subject -- i''ve seen these before -- but i think it would have more impact if it were just one or two knives, and against a totally black background.  as shot, i think it''s too mundane.', '2007-04-23 13:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573594, 501409, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love the mood of this</td>', 'I love the mood of this', '2007-04-23 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573597, 501461, 4162, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this shot</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this shot', '2007-04-23 13:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573600, 501405, 4162, '<td valign="top">interesting-it looks quite alien!</td>', 'interesting-it looks quite alien!', '2007-04-23 13:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573603, 500567, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is cool- i really like the colours</td>', 'This is cool- i really like the colours', '2007-04-23 13:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573605, 500816, 56880, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I keep thinking of the old "I feel like chicken tonight" commercials, with the dancing chicken in the oven.  Bizarre stuff.  Detail is sharp throughout the picture, giving a nice context to the "peeking in" shot, and the fork make a nice framing element.  The only distraction is in the upper right, which might be a temperature gauge.</td>', 'For some reason, I keep thinking of the old "I feel like chicken tonight" commercials, with the dancing chicken in the oven.  Bizarre stuff.  Detail is sharp throughout the picture, giving a nice context to the "peeking in" shot, and the fork make a nice framing element.  The only distraction is in the upper right, which might be a temperature gauge.', '2007-04-23 13:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573606, 501399, 4162, '<td valign="top">I bet this took a bit of setting up-good shot</td>', 'I bet this took a bit of setting up-good shot', '2007-04-23 13:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
