(3574331, 498532, 73235, '<td valign="top">I guess you did not use a tripod: the picture is slightly out of focus. The harsh light coming from the left blows out a lot of detail in the bright areas. Your POV is not really centered. You can see that at the lines of the stove being parallel to the picture border. If you look at the top, you can see the angle of the cabinets and the upper picture border.</td>', 'I guess you did not use a tripod: the picture is slightly out of focus. The harsh light coming from the left blows out a lot of detail in the bright areas. Your POV is not really centered. You can see that at the lines of the stove being parallel to the picture border. If you look at the top, you can see the angle of the cabinets and the upper picture border.', '2007-04-23 17:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
