(3577660, 501110, 9690, '<td valign="top">Some may hammer you over the lighting, but I think here it really makes it look like a painting.  The candle is a bit overpowering, but that could be taken care of with some creative editing.  My only other suggestion is that you have too much stuff in the image.  Cut down on it a bit and make it simpler.  Too much is competing for the eyes'' attention.</td>', 'Some may hammer you over the lighting, but I think here it really makes it look like a painting.  The candle is a bit overpowering, but that could be taken care of with some creative editing.  My only other suggestion is that you have too much stuff in the image.  Cut down on it a bit and make it simpler.  Too much is competing for the eyes'' attention.', '2007-04-24 16:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
