(3579237, 498532, 65858, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is.<br/> <br/>But there are a number of things wrong with this:<br/> <br/>The composition is pretty rough (wide angle makes straight lines look curved), items are half in the shot along the edges, it''s pretty noisy and not well in focus.<br/> <br/>Moreover, this is not an really an interesting story, unless you''re trying to tell that of mundane, everyday life.  Which people aren''t really interested in looking at, because they''re living it.  =)<br/> <br/>This was a tough topic, because it tended toward the mundane.  The shots that will do well will probably make you look at kitchenware in a unique way.<br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/>-Jeff</td>', 'Yes, it is. But there are a number of things wrong with this: The composition is pretty rough (wide angle makes straight lines look curved), items are half in the shot along the edges, it''s pretty noisy and not well in focus. Moreover, this is not an really an interesting story, unless you''re trying to tell that of mundane, everyday life.  Which people aren''t really interested in looking at, because they''re living it.  =) This was a tough topic, because it tended toward the mundane.  The shots that will do well will probably make you look at kitchenware in a unique way. Cheers!-Jeff', '2007-04-25 00:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
