(3586888, 501498, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but overprocessed (the halo around the hand is very distracting) and I''d have either cropped tighter or included the whole hand.</td>', 'Good concept, but overprocessed (the halo around the hand is very distracting) and I''d have either cropped tighter or included the whole hand.', '2007-04-26 23:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3586903, 501140, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept! Normally I don''t like this completely over-the-top grunge look, but it sorta fits here. My one big complaint is the eye being obscured by the flying food.</td>', 'Interesting concept! Normally I don''t like this completely over-the-top grunge look, but it sorta fits here. My one big complaint is the eye being obscured by the flying food.', '2007-04-26 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
