(3587042, 501461, 13688, '<td valign="top">great feel.  i wish you left the apron? off as i love the color and texture of the chair and it would have been a nice place for the eyes to rest from the busy but interesting counter above.</td>', 'great feel.  i wish you left the apron? off as i love the color and texture of the chair and it would have been a nice place for the eyes to rest from the busy but interesting counter above.', '2007-04-27 00:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
