(3587068, 498532, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like the vibe of this pic.  the slight oof and sharp lighting gives it an uncomfortable feel for me.  i wonder how the bottom is fairly straight but the top is so slanted...very interesting...very odd.</td>', 'i really like the vibe of this pic.  the slight oof and sharp lighting gives it an uncomfortable feel for me.  i wonder how the bottom is fairly straight but the top is so slanted...very interesting...very odd.', '2007-04-27 00:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
