(3592122, 498952, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the focus on this and b&amp;w is a good choice for bringing attention to the play of light on the metal.</td>', 'I like the focus on this and b&w is a good choice for bringing attention to the play of light on the metal.', '2007-04-29 11:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592124, 501458, 61651, '<td valign="top">Mixer whisk as light fixture - I love it - very creatively done.  Nice background color and lighting.</td>', 'Mixer whisk as light fixture - I love it - very creatively done.  Nice background color and lighting.', '2007-04-29 11:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592126, 501482, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice selective focus and and the reflections give a depth that holds the viewer''s interest.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice selective focus and and the reflections give a depth that holds the viewer''s interest.  Great job.', '2007-04-29 11:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592132, 500774, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes you captured here.  Usually reflections can be a distraction, but I think the symmetry of the reflections adds to the abstract nature of the image and fits in really well.</td>', 'I like the shapes you captured here.  Usually reflections can be a distraction, but I think the symmetry of the reflections adds to the abstract nature of the image and fits in really well.', '2007-04-29 11:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592134, 500457, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view and well framed. You could have entered this in Rule of Thirds! :) Is this a duotone? - very nice.  Started at 8, bumping to a 9.</td>', 'Nice point of view and well framed. You could have entered this in Rule of Thirds! :) Is this a duotone? - very nice.  Started at 8, bumping to a 9.', '2007-04-29 11:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592135, 501130, 61651, '<td valign="top">Simple, spare, and nicely arranged in the frame.</td>', 'Simple, spare, and nicely arranged in the frame.', '2007-04-29 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592138, 501483, 70821, '<td valign="top">foreground is too distracting from the focus</td>', 'foreground is too distracting from the focus', '2007-04-29 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592140, 500245, 61651, '<td valign="top">Lit well, and the point of focus and angled composition works for this image, IMO.</td>', 'Lit well, and the point of focus and angled composition works for this image, IMO.', '2007-04-29 11:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592141, 501461, 70821, '<td valign="top">great composition, rated 8 for the distracting lighting.  Not sure the lamp would have been in the original kitchen</td>', 'great composition, rated 8 for the distracting lighting.  Not sure the lamp would have been in the original kitchen', '2007-04-29 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592145, 501015, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice spare and interesting shot, but - yes how ironic to say this - perhaps a bit oversharpened. :)  There seems just too pronounced an edge around the apple for it to be natural.  Maybe it''s my monitor - one of the better shots though, I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Nice spare and interesting shot, but - yes how ironic to say this - perhaps a bit oversharpened. :)  There seems just too pronounced an edge around the apple for it to be natural.  Maybe it''s my monitor - one of the better shots though, I gave it an 8.', '2007-04-29 11:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592149, 501494, 70821, '<td valign="top">could have been a 10 for me, with better DOF with all forks in clear focus.</td>', 'could have been a 10 for me, with better DOF with all forks in clear focus.', '2007-04-29 11:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592150, 501494, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea and like very much the shapes you created with the composition, but would have preferred to see the focus extend a bit farther back in the shot.</td>', 'This is a good idea and like very much the shapes you created with the composition, but would have preferred to see the focus extend a bit farther back in the shot.', '2007-04-29 11:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592157, 501140, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is a funny idea, good pose and expression on the model, but the post-processing looks too overdone for me to really, really like it.  Still gets above average - I gave this a 7.</td>', 'This is a funny idea, good pose and expression on the model, but the post-processing looks too overdone for me to really, really like it.  Still gets above average - I gave this a 7.', '2007-04-29 11:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592160, 500784, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice experiment in selective focus, good angle so the subject extends across the frame.</td>', 'Nice experiment in selective focus, good angle so the subject extends across the frame.', '2007-04-29 11:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592164, 500280, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very likely one of the oddest days in this chicken''s life, if not also for the photographer''s. What would our neighbors think if they could see us shooting for these challenges? LOL  Nice idea and good focus on the chicken''s head.</td>', 'Very likely one of the oddest days in this chicken''s life, if not also for the photographer''s. What would our neighbors think if they could see us shooting for these challenges? LOL  Nice idea and good focus on the chicken''s head.', '2007-04-29 11:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592168, 500546, 61651, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective - I like how you set it up so as to appear that the slicer has the egg in its crosshairs.  The added slice on the right is a good idea - it adds another point of visual interest to the composition.</td>', 'Interesting perspective - I like how you set it up so as to appear that the slicer has the egg in its crosshairs.  The added slice on the right is a good idea - it adds another point of visual interest to the composition.', '2007-04-29 11:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592171, 501114, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like this composition, and the softening, old-timey focus for the background, but wish I could see more detail in the background, particularly on the left side of the image - would have preferred a touch more lightening in the darker areas.</td>', 'I like this composition, and the softening, old-timey focus for the background, but wish I could see more detail in the background, particularly on the left side of the image - would have preferred a touch more lightening in the darker areas.', '2007-04-29 11:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592178, 501387, 61651, '<td valign="top">Like how you got level with the subject here - the way the handle juts off to the left is distracting though, and unbalances the composition which is otherwise set up to be fairly symmetrical. Perhaps it would have been better to use a pot without a handle like that, like with two small handles on either side?</td>', 'Like how you got level with the subject here - the way the handle juts off to the left is distracting though, and unbalances the composition which is otherwise set up to be fairly symmetrical. Perhaps it would have been better to use a pot without a handle like that, like with two small handles on either side?', '2007-04-29 12:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592191, 501399, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes you were going for here, but think the image suffers from being over-lit.</td>', 'I like the shapes you were going for here, but think the image suffers from being over-lit.', '2007-04-29 12:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592212, 500462, 24389, '<td valign="top">lol,  this is cool!</td>', 'lol,  this is cool!', '2007-04-29 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592375, 501244, 60595, '<td valign="top">Fantastic expression on the child''s face.</td>', 'Fantastic expression on the child''s face.', '2007-04-29 14:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592409, 501069, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the way the table (or placemat) complements the tea cup.</td>', 'Very nice. I love the way the table (or placemat) complements the tea cup.', '2007-04-29 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592419, 501460, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the blues and greens. I also like the way the pitcher seems to mimic the flames. I think the touch of red in the upper left is distracting, and I would score it even higher without the flowers. 8</td>', 'Love the blues and greens. I also like the way the pitcher seems to mimic the flames. I think the touch of red in the upper left is distracting, and I would score it even higher without the flowers. 8', '2007-04-29 14:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592421, 501021, 66384, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t get the spoons to stand up without that plastic rack. I think the white rack is very distracting, but the rest of the image is fabulous. The reflection in the spoons is beautiful and interesting.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t get the spoons to stand up without that plastic rack. I think the white rack is very distracting, but the rest of the image is fabulous. The reflection in the spoons is beautiful and interesting.', '2007-04-29 14:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592428, 501469, 66384, '<td valign="top">The lines and patterns are very nice, but I think at least a little of the image should be in sharp focus.</td>', 'The lines and patterns are very nice, but I think at least a little of the image should be in sharp focus.', '2007-04-29 14:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592438, 501140, 52549, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! This looks like a ribbon winner to me. Good luck!</td>', 'Brilliant! This looks like a ribbon winner to me. Good luck!', '2007-04-29 15:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592443, 499087, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great colours, great lighting.</td>', 'Great idea, great colours, great lighting.', '2007-04-29 15:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592605, 501487, 62006, '<td valign="top">What the....:) Very creative. Good luck to you.</td>', 'What the....:) Very creative. Good luck to you.', '2007-04-29 16:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592618, 500761, 24389, '<td valign="top">when its a plastic fried egg?</td>', 'when its a plastic fried egg?', '2007-04-29 17:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592622, 500805, 62006, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and too small. Good idea..just could have been composed better.</td>', 'Out of focus and too small. Good idea..just could have been composed better.', '2007-04-29 17:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592625, 501397, 62006, '<td valign="top">I have one of these and almost did something similar. Good composition and color. Good luck to you.</td>', 'I have one of these and almost did something similar. Good composition and color. Good luck to you.', '2007-04-29 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
