(3592695, 501469, 35804, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...the bokeh and blur are just awesome. The longer I look at this the more I like it.</td>', 'Cool shot...the bokeh and blur are just awesome. The longer I look at this the more I like it.', '2007-04-29 17:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
