(3594380, 501416, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jodiecoston:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave this a 10.  The *only* 10?  Gimmie a break!  It''s beautiful!  I can see it on the cover of a cookbook or hanging as a huge print in a restaurant.  Gorgeous color tones and beautiful composition.  I wish I had taken this.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thankyou Jodie for your score, fave and comment.  I am pleased that someone else liked my image other than myself.    Thankyou.</td>', 'Originally posted by jodiecoston: I gave this a 10.  The *only* 10?  Gimmie a break!  It''s beautiful!  I can see it on the cover of a cookbook or hanging as a huge print in a restaurant.  Gorgeous color tones and beautiful composition.  I wish I had taken this.  :)   Thankyou Jodie for your score, fave and comment.  I am pleased that someone else liked my image other than myself.    Thankyou.', '2007-04-30 03:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
