(3594466, 501409, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely find for this challenge.  My favorite part is the chest and stool to the right side, though I''m not sure why - maybe the light and the texture.  And while this is a fine shot, well done, nicely composed and fits the challenge well, it''s a sad reflection of the DPC voting mass that this is your new highest score.  And don''t you dare let Monty fall off the page...  :-)</td>', 'Lovely find for this challenge.  My favorite part is the chest and stool to the right side, though I''m not sure why - maybe the light and the texture.  And while this is a fine shot, well done, nicely composed and fits the challenge well, it''s a sad reflection of the DPC voting mass that this is your new highest score.  And don''t you dare let Monty fall off the page...  :-)', '2007-04-30 03:53:32.000000', NULL, 0),
