(3595035, 501409, 67697, '<td valign="top">I did get to vote on this during the challenge and thought it was great!  I loved the nostalgic feel to it.  Quite a contrast to some of the modern kitchens on display in the challenge.  Although, I''d rather be cooking in one of those modern kitchens than this one lol.  Congrats on your placement!</td>', 'I did get to vote on this during the challenge and thought it was great!  I loved the nostalgic feel to it.  Quite a contrast to some of the modern kitchens on display in the challenge.  Although, I''d rather be cooking in one of those modern kitchens than this one lol.  Congrats on your placement!', '2007-04-30 08:53:50.000000', NULL, 0),
