(3595237, 501340, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is such a creative take on the challenge and nicely composed.  Even like the vignette!  An underrated shot.</td>', 'This is such a creative take on the challenge and nicely composed.  Even like the vignette!  An underrated shot.', '2007-04-30 09:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
