(3595445, 501469, 32767, '<td valign="top">A big problem I have when voting, is decifering whether or not someone made a deliberate artistic choice or a bad image. Knowing that this is yours, I''m looking deeper and seeing the beauty revealed in this simple object.<br/> <br/>Sadly, I gave it a 4. <br/> <br/>On a bright note. A few of my lowest scoring images have sold for good money. It''s funny how that works...<br/> <br/>C''est la vie...c''est la guerre<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-30 10:11:29.</i></td>', 'A big problem I have when voting, is decifering whether or not someone made a deliberate artistic choice or a bad image. Knowing that this is yours, I''m looking deeper and seeing the beauty revealed in this simple object. Sadly, I gave it a 4.  On a bright note. A few of my lowest scoring images have sold for good money. It''s funny how that works... C''est la vie...c''est la guerre', '2007-04-30 11:08:04.000000', '2007-04-30 11:11:29.000000', 0),
