(3598177, 500983, 554, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo and well deserving of a blue.  However, to me it is a rather unusual angle of the knife.....I''da had it tilted the other way ie: the handle  tilted to the left.  and rotated 180.  Oh, what the heck do I know...I like it but it just don''t look normal, which prolly ain''t no big deal to most folks.  I guess thats why it placed first, It is a great photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-30 22:10:55.</i></td>', 'This is a great photo and well deserving of a blue.  However, to me it is a rather unusual angle of the knife.....I''da had it tilted the other way ie: the handle  tilted to the left.  and rotated 180.  Oh, what the heck do I know...I like it but it just don''t look normal, which prolly ain''t no big deal to most folks.  I guess thats why it placed first, It is a great photo.', '2007-04-30 23:09:49.000000', '2007-04-30 23:10:55.000000', 0),
